   "QUESTION_DESC": "<h3 data-end=\"813\" data-start=\"727\"><strong data-end=\"811\" data-start=\"731\">Which model allows many user threads to be mapped to many kernel threads?</strong></h3>\n\n<p data-end=\"881\" data-start=\"814\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"480\" data-start=\"413\">&nbsp;</p>\n",
