   "QUESTION_DESC": "<h3 data-end=\"1257\" data-start=\"1186\"><strong data-end=\"1255\" data-start=\"1190\">Which model provides the most flexibility and scalability?</strong></h3>\n\n<p data-end=\"1320\" data-start=\"1258\">A.<br data-end=\"1275\" data-start=\"1272\" />\nB.<br data-end=\"1291\" data-start=\"1288\" />\nC.<br data-end=\"1309\" data-start=\"1306\" />\nD.</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"1349\" data-start=\"1322\"><strong data-end=\"1333\" data-start=\"1322\">Answer:</strong> C. Many-to-Many</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"1119\" data-start=\"979\">&nbsp;</p>\n",
